            <title>1.13.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 13:35:56 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/stefanlange/ccInfo</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.13.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.13.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Redesign the 5-hour usage chart: taller, with a smoothed curve, a fill that fades from the line toward the baseline, and a soft glow on the current value</li>
<li>Blend the chart color gradually from green to yellow as usage rises, instead of holding flat green and then shifting abruptly near the top</li>
<li>Translate the Reload and error buttons into German (they previously showed English), and reword the reset countdown, weekly-limit, and token-limit messages for more natural German</li>
</ul>

]]></description>
